## Glossary:

- **Sandbox:** A testing environment for the agent builder to experiment in. Sandboxes are built in the Earned Media (EM) or GMG Admin (GA) workspace with **workspace** visibility. They should NOT be visible to the Copy Squad/GMG team.
- **Testing Edition:** A testing environment containing a stable release that users can employ on live projects to evaluate its usability and output. Testing editions are built in the EM/GA workspace with **Organization**-level visibility. Copy Squad/GMG team members will be able to see and use them.
- **Live Agent:** A published, polished agent that has passed all testing and is intended for use by the team at large. Live agents are built in the EM/GA workspace with **Organization**-level visibility. Copy Squad/GMG team members will be able to see and use them.

